{"about_the_game":"Description:<br />\r\nYou become a tiny gnome who finds himself in a dark dungeon full of dangers and secrets. You have an axe and a bow at your disposal, which will help you fight a variety of enemies. Each new level becomes more difficult and full of opponents, requiring strategic thinking and quick reactions from you. The game combines platforming elements and exciting puzzles that will force you to show your wits and dexterity. Explore the dark corners of the dungeon, collect crystals and gold, and use the environment to your advantage to survive this dangerous adventure. Don't forget to find hidden objects and upgrades that will help you become even stronger in the fight against the dark forces!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n2D platformer puzzle game in pixel art style.<br />\r\nThe main goal at the levels is a key-door.<br />\r\nStrategy and tactics of fast action.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3551320?t=1743010444","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3551320?t=1743010444","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551320/8fadc2f45d63a44e977324747fc849b346509a8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743010444","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551320/8fadc2f45d63a44e977324747fc849b346509a8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743010444","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Description:<br />\r\nYou become a tiny gnome who finds himself in a dark dungeon full of dangers and secrets. You have an axe and a bow at your disposal, which will help you fight a variety of enemies. Each new level becomes more difficult and full of opponents, requiring strategic thinking and quick reactions from you. The game combines platforming elements and exciting puzzles that will force you to show your wits and dexterity. Explore the dark corners of the dungeon, collect crystals and gold, and use the environment to your advantage to survive this dangerous adventure. Don't forget to find hidden objects and upgrades that will help you become even stronger in the fight against the dark forces!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n2D platformer puzzle game in pixel art style.<br />\r\nThe main goal at the levels is a key-door.<br />\r\nStrategy and tactics of fast action.","developers":["Verbal Chambers"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551320/852fd67aef699bbc5f60bd85cf7a5c76124b13d6/header.jpg?t=1743010444","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257114696,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114696/movie480.mp4?t=1743010441","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114696/movie_max.mp4?t=1743010441"},"name":"Main","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257114696/e9ec8d5f99821d870922e5a3bccb9e0b2f342248/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743010441","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114696/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743010441","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114696/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743010441"}}],"name":"Shiny Stones","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512mb<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac